  <Name>k__BackingField: Homing Orbs
  <Description>k__BackingField: Spawn 3 <i><color=#5A5A5A>(+1 per level)</color></i>
    orbs around you that deal 12 <i><color=#5A5A5A>(+3 per level)</color></i> damage
